# This folder holds AWS IoT Core device certificates (NOT committed to git).
# Place your three downloaded files here:
#   - device-certificate.pem.crt   (device certificate)
#   - device-private.pem.key       (private key)
#   - AmazonRootCA1.pem            (Amazon Root CA 1)
# The *.pem / *.key / *.crt files are gitignored; only this .gitkeep is tracked.
